<mxfile host="Electron" pages="5">
  <diagram id="23hE2xUeqPSeFH-Eny3Z" name="Sequence-Diagram_Workflow1">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1725" dy="1013" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nautonumber\nskinparam BoxPadding 10\nskinparam ParticipantPadding 10\nskinparam ResponseMessageBelowArrow true\n\nactor \&quot;Lecturer\&quot; as LEC\nparticipant \&quot;Frontend UI\&quot; as FE\nparticipant \&quot;Question Controller\\n&amp; Service\&quot; as BE\nparticipant \&quot;Embedding Service\\n(OpenAI)\&quot; as EMB\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\\n(pgvector)\&quot; as DB\nparticipant \&quot;AI Service\\n(GPT-4o / Gemini)\&quot; as AI\n\n== Phase 1: AI-Powered Question &amp; Rubric Generation (RAG Pipeline) ==\n\nLEC -&gt; FE: Select subject, enter topic keyword,\\nchoose Bloom level (Remember/Understand/Apply/Analyze)\nactivate LEC\nFE -&gt; BE: POST /questions/generate\\n{subjectId, keyword, bloomLevel, count, materialIds}\nactivate FE\nactivate BE\n\nBE -&gt; BE: Validate authorization &amp; subject assignment\\n(requireAssignment)\nBE -&gt; EMB: Generate vector embedding for keyword (1536-dim)\nactivate EMB\nEMB --&gt; BE: Embedding vector float[]\ndeactivate EMB\n\nBE -&gt; DB: Query Top-5 relevant material chunks\\n(searchSimilarChunks via Cosine Distance &lt;=&gt; pgvector)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; BE: Document context chunks (syllabus / lecture slides)\ndeactivate DB\n\nBE -&gt; AI: Send Prompt (Document context + Keyword + Bloom level)\\nrequest question &amp; scoring rubric\nactivate AI\nAI --&gt; BE: Return JSON: Question + Answer + Bloom + Rubric criteria\ndeactivate AI\n\nBE -&gt; DB: Save Question (status: DRAFT, isAiGenerated: true)\\n+ Rubric &amp; Criteria + AuditLog (\&quot;CREATED\&quot;)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; BE: Persisted successfully\ndeactivate DB\n\nBE --&gt; FE: Return draft questions &amp; rubrics (HTTP 201 Created)\ndeactivate BE\nFE --&gt; LEC: Display generated questions for review\ndeactivate FE\n\n== Phase 2: Lecturer Review, Edit &amp; Approval ==\n\nalt Case 1: Edit Question Content / Rubric / Bloom Level\n    LEC -&gt; FE: Edit question text, reference answer, or rubric criteria\n    activate FE\n    FE -&gt; BE: PATCH /questions/{id}\\n{content, referenceAnswer, bloomLevel, ...}\n    activate BE\n    BE -&gt; DB: Update Question &amp; Rubric + AuditLog (\&quot;UPDATED\&quot;)\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; BE: Updated successfully\n    deactivate DB\n    BE --&gt; FE: Return QuestionResponse (HTTP 200 OK)\n    deactivate BE\n    FE --&gt; LEC: Display update confirmation\n    deactivate FE\n\nelse Case 2: Approve into Official Question Bank\n    LEC -&gt; FE: Click \&quot;Approve\&quot; button\n    activate FE\n    FE -&gt; BE: POST /questions/{id}/approve\n    activate BE\n    BE -&gt; DB: Set status = APPROVED, isApproved = true\\n+ AuditLog (\&quot;UPDATED\&quot;)\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; BE: Persisted successfully\n    deactivate DB\n    BE --&gt; FE: Return approved question (HTTP 200 OK)\n    deactivate BE\n    FE --&gt; LEC: Question added to official bank\n    deactivate FE\n\nelse Case 3: Discard / Delete Rejected Question\n    LEC -&gt; FE: Click \&quot;Delete / Discard\&quot; button\n    activate FE\n    FE -&gt; BE: DELETE /questions/{id}\n    activate BE\n    BE -&gt; DB: Verify unused in exams -&gt; Delete draft\\n+ AuditLog (\&quot;DELETED\&quot;)\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; BE: Deleted successfully\n    deactivate DB\n    BE --&gt; FE: Return HTTP 200 OK\n    deactivate BE\n    FE --&gt; LEC: Question removed from drafts\n    deactivate FE\nend\n\n== Phase 3: Manual Question &amp; Rubric Creation (Optional) ==\n\nopt Lecturer creates question manually\n    LEC -&gt; FE: Enter question text, Bloom level, reference answer, and rubric\n    activate FE\n    FE -&gt; BE: POST /questions\\n{subjectId, content, bloomLevel, referenceAnswer, ...}\n    activate BE\n    BE -&gt; DB: Save Question (sourceType: MANUAL, status: DRAFT) + AuditLog\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; BE: Persisted successfully\n    deactivate DB\n    BE --&gt; FE: Return QuestionResponse (HTTP 201 Created)\n    deactivate BE\n    FE --&gt; LEC: Question created successfully\n    deactivate FE\nend\n\ndeactivate LEC\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="GTCAnvNDzEKr-ei04ZLf-1">
